/target
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
apps/desktop/dist
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
# Target-specific deployment checker binaries staged for Tauri packaging.
apps/desktop/src-tauri/binaries/
# Any level, not just apps/desktop: running `npx vitest` from the repo root writes a cache to
# `./node_modules/.vite/`, which then shows up as untracked at the root and is easy to commit by
# accident during a `git add -A`.
node_modules/
*.db
.idea
.vscode
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
*.db-journal
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.env
.env.*
sidecars/wda/DerivedData/
sidecars/wda/build_payload/
# Helper APK build output. Both paths are intermediates — the shipped artifact is the copy
# pinned at sidecars/android/noarch/riviu-agent.apk, and committing an unpinned build next to
# it is how two APKs with the same name come to disagree.
sidecars/riviu-android-agent/build-tools-out/
sidecars/riviu-android-agent/app/build/
sidecars/riviu-android-agent/local.properties
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcuserstate
# UI hierarchy dumps. `uiautomator dump` / `label_scout --raw` write these wherever the shell
# happened to be, which is usually the repo root, and they carry the device serial plus whatever
# the account was looking at — real handles, real captions, real comment text. Eleven of them sat
# untracked at the root on 24/08/2026, one `git add -A` away from being published. Dump into
# target/ (already ignored) when you want to keep one.
*.xml
!apps/desktop/**/*.xml
!sidecars/**/*.xml
# yt-dlp sidecar. 17 MB of third-party binary that goes stale on TikTok's schedule, not
# ours -- fetched per machine and per release build instead of carried in history. See
# sidecars/yt-dlp/README.md for the one-line curl and for why the lookup is optional.
sidecars/yt-dlp/*.exe
sidecars/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
sidecars/yt-dlp/yt-dlp-manifest.json
# Agent tooling's own copy of the skills tree, written per session. `.claude/skills/` is the
# versioned one (see the `!.claude/skills/` rule above); this is a rewritten duplicate of it,
# and committing an agent's scratch copy beside the real one is how two skill files with the
# same name come to disagree.
.agents/
# Length-prefixed MJPEG copies are reconstructible from the retained evidence JPEG.
docs/re/riviu-agent/**/*.framed
